  "body": "The request of the maintainer (relayed 2026-11-17, quoted in #2392): \"have it setup a bunch of examples.. for debugging..\", with \"docs off the operation pages\".\n\n## What\n\nAdd a file `case.toml` to each case folder of `examples/catalog/`. The file holds `kinds = [...]`, `machine` and `expect`. The README of the case stays prose.\n\nGenerate an \"Example cases\" list below each kind heading of the operation pages:\n- `site/content/guide/operations/operations-{2d,3d,turning,edm,plasma,probing}.md`\n- `site/content/guide/multi-axis/operations-multiaxis.md`\n\nThe kind names come from `KindInfo::ALL` in `crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs`. The tool is `xtask/src/catalog.rs`.\n\n## Evidence\n\nThe operation pages have no link into `examples/` today. Each kind has its own `##` heading.\n\nDone means: `cargo xtask catalog --check` fails for a case that has no link, and for a link that names no case. It fails for a `case.toml` that names an unknown kind. The seed case `2d/first-part` shows below Face, 2D Pocket and Drill.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
